{"type": "message", "id": "2913768a", "parentId": "b510e163", "timestamp": "2026-04-24T08:57:48.405Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_t8rdkap0vh5nnbnrfes8z8fa", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"Symmetric Noise Real-World llama3-70b zeroshot paper title\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 960,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"44f51d14f916b94b\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nr/LocalLLaMA on Reddit: The incredible zero-shot roleplay ability of LLaMa3\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"44f51d14f916b94b\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.reddit.com/r/LocalLLaMA/comments/1c9v2k3/the_incredible_zeroshot_roleplay_ability_of_llama3/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3f620821c439f3dc\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nOut of MM-1.0-103b, Command-r+ and 70b-instruct, L3 is somewhere in the middle. It tends to write less and likes to devolve into all caps. It tends to summarize what you said and repeat it back to you in the message. Steers away from NSFW sort of like Qwen did.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3f620821c439f3dc\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"April 21, 2024\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.reddit.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1e49c4c63cea250a\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe Uniqueness of LLaMA3-70B Series with Per-Channel Quantization\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1e49c4c63cea250a\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://arxiv.org/html/2408.15301v2\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f07a5bdb963e4d67\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThis approach significantly reduces the dynamic range required for quantization, enabling the LLaMA3-70B model series to retain accuracy comparable to their FP16 counterparts. In this paper, we use <strong>symmetric integer-bit quantization due to its high efficiency and simpler hardware support</strong>.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f07a5bdb963e4d67\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"October 1, 2024\",\n      \"siteName\": \"arxiv.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"19842da8ff3e8052\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe Uniqueness of LLaMA3-70B with Per-Channel Quantization: An Empirical Study\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"19842da8ff3e8052\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://arxiv.org/html/2408.15301v1\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"29f0fc80eae81352\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThis approach applies per-group quantization to less than 3% of the layers, specifically those with significant weight outliers, while maintaining per-channel quantization for the remaining 97% layers. This mixed strategy effectively restores the accuracy of the LLaMA3-70B model series to levels comparable to its FP16 counterparts. In this paper, we use symmetric integer-bit quantization due to its high efficiency and simpler hardware support.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"29f0fc80eae81352\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"August 27, 2024\",\n      \"siteName\": \"arxiv.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8ffd024a26fda65a\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n[2408.15301] The Uniqueness of LLaMA3-70B Series with Per-Channel Quantization\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8ffd024a26fda65a\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2408.15301\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f3cc34bec759f5a3\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAbstract page for <strong>arXiv paper 2408.15301</strong>: The Uniqueness of LLaMA3-70B Series with Per-Channel Quantization\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f3cc34bec759f5a3\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"October 1, 2024\",\n      \"siteName\": \"arxiv.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"32e9064c722ad3c6\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n(PDF) The Uniqueness of LLaMA3-70B with Per-Channel Quantization: An Empirical Study\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"32e9064c722ad3c6\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/383494177_The_Uniqueness_of_LLaMA3-70B_with_Per-Channel_Quantization_An_Empirical_Study\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5bd1ed1aa45615f1\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n<strong>the accuracy of the LLaMA3-70B model series to levels comparable to its FP16 counterparts</strong>. ... In this paper, we use symmetric integer-bit quantization due to its high efﬁciency and simpler hardware support.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5bd1ed1aa45615f1\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"August 29, 2024\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.researchgate.net\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}], "details": {"query": "Symmetric Noise Real-World llama3-70b zeroshot paper title", "provider": "brave", "count": 5, "tookMs": 960, "externalContent": {"untrusted": true, "source": "web_search", "provider": "brave", "wrapped": true}, "results": [{"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"44f51d14f916b94b\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nr/LocalLLaMA on Reddit: The incredible zero-shot roleplay ability of LLaMa3\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"44f51d14f916b94b\">>>", "url": "https://www.reddit.com/r/LocalLLaMA/comments/1c9v2k3/the_incredible_zeroshot_roleplay_ability_of_llama3/", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"3f620821c439f3dc\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nOut of MM-1.0-103b, Command-r+ and 70b-instruct, L3 is somewhere in the middle. It tends to write less and likes to devolve into all caps. It tends to summarize what you said and repeat it back to you 