{"type": "message", "id": "be33dff8", "parentId": "61b584a7", "timestamp": "2026-04-24T08:58:02.106Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_jnuv50ephece2foexuxhkv87", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"symmetric noise zero-shot relation extraction llama3\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 947,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"55e072eea85478b0\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTailoring Large Language Models for Zero-Shot Relation ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"55e072eea85478b0\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://aclanthology.org/2024.emnlp-main.747.pdf\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"325ca61604706caa\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n<strong>Extraction setting are based on the down-sampled subsets with 30 samples/relation to reduce inference cost</strong>.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"325ca61604706caa\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"aclanthology.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c6961c9b5493c8cf\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n1 Zero-Shot Document-Level Biomedical Relation Extraction via\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c6961c9b5493c8cf\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2505.01077\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ac4c030eb2fcbccf\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nespecially in biomedical realm. Recent research on LLMs, such as GPT-4 and Llama3, has shown · promising performance in zero-shot settings, inspiring us to explore a novel approach to achieve the · same results from unannotated full documents using general LLMs with lower hardware and labor ·\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ac4c030eb2fcbccf\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"arxiv.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"09b2944b1433588d\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nRevisiting Large Language Models as Zero-shot Relation Extractors\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"09b2944b1433588d\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/376393310_Revisiting_Large_Language_Models_as_Zero-shot_Relation_Extractors\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5c8d93ee2ea8f590\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTo construct reliable supervision, we generate high-fidelity vendor labels for the IoT Inspector dataset, the largest real-world IoT traffic corpus, using an ensemble of large language models guided by mutual-information and entropy-based stability scores. We then instruction-tune a quantized LLaMA3.18B model with curriculum learning to support generalization under sparsity and long-tail vendor distributions.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5c8d93ee2ea8f590\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"January 1, 2023\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.researchgate.net\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1f0c3236cdbe32a0\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAnalysing zero-shot temporal relation extraction on clinical notes using temporal consistency\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1f0c3236cdbe32a0\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://arxiv.org/html/2406.11486v1\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"48dedfea97e3e323\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n<strong>This paper presents the first study for temporal relation extraction in a zero-shot setting focusing on biomedical text</strong>. We employ two types of prompts and five LLMs (GPT-3.5, Mixtral, Llama 2, Gemma, and PMC-LLaMA) to obtain responses about the temporal relations between two events.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"48dedfea97e3e323\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"June 17, 2024\",\n      \"siteName\": \"arxiv.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"185725eb2d4f7169\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nRelation Extraction with Llama3 Models | Towards Data Science\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"185725eb2d4f7169\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://towardsdatascience.com/relation-extraction-with-llama3-models-f8bc41858b9e/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"33f3d12c901f6e5c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nSpecifically, with the help of Llama3–70B, we build a supervised fine-tuning dataset aimed at relation extraction.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"33f3d12c901f6e5c\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"January 19, 2025\",\n      \"siteName\": \"towardsdatascience.com\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}], "details": {"query": "symmetric noise zero-shot relation extraction llama3", "provider": "brave", "count": 5, "tookMs": 947, "externalContent": {"untrusted": true, "source": "web_search", "provider": "brave", "wrapped": true}, "results": [{"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"55e072eea85478b0\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nTailoring Large Language Models for Zero-Shot Relation ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"55e072eea85478b0\">>>", "url": "https://aclanthology.org/2024.emnlp-main.747.pdf", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"325ca61604706caa\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n<strong>Extraction setting are based on the down-sampled subsets with 30 samples/relation to reduce inference cost</strong>.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"325ca61604706caa\">>>", "siteName": "aclanthology.org"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"c6961c9b5493c8cf\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n1 Zero-Shot Document-Level Biomedical Relation Extraction via\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"c6961c9b5493c8cf\">>>", "url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2505.01077", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id